{
  "id": "ACT.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Gadiyeeda Giijasoodiga 25",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bawlo ghoang'aata girgweageadaanyi heeda sugoocheanda haweewa sean.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwahidu Festo jeeda ng'eanyiidaanyi, ng'ata eawooji samwagu hean ghang'eat ak gawa Yerusalemu nea ghabeawa Gaysariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat ashoohoodiga hees sea fuga hees bea Yahudi ak geataw iita girgweageeda Bawlo, hean geemus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghamwas eeyeadu siida Yerusalemu, aba gideaba geasach naweeda jea eabwara ghami damanda mideewa naweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Festo ak gwayeesha, Bawlo geefur aba hoowa bea Gaysariyahiin, ak aniini geagasayi dawa hoowa askwearjoojisu duwaawiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi,” aba ginyah, “fugiga ambaliischi aba jeedeang'wean anung' deadeayi, ama iimida ng'asheanda muy nisin siisi abeeda goorgweaksa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata giibindeaba hoowa eawooji sis ghana damanamughuush sea saawa, iidu gawa Gaysariya, muchu gawa jeeda gheeda sirgweacha ak goopteada aba hoorgeeda amahit gwayeesha ayeani Bawlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geeyeadu, hean gwaneaweesa fuga Yahudi leabu Yerusalemu ak geahaakta, hean geenapiisa ng'asheega saang'a durumani moamu googiingiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaweat geaw Bawlo nea gwayeesha, “Aniini manda giidiinyeanji neasinyi bea ng'asheega deaweedeeda fuga Yahudi, ghana gheeda sibata ASEETA ghana ramaseanda aba heeda sugoocheanda siguura Gaysari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo abeeda gagasa ghoamiidu geaw aba heeda fuga Yahudi, hean ghoanyaash Bawlo nea gwayeesha, “Gigasayi una Yerusalemu ak geergweakseey aba ng'asheesu nea gindi madeedeanyu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Bawlo ak gwayeesha, “Aniini ghaamiinaadi aba heeda sirgweacha bea Gaysari, ak hiji ea heeda miisean eergweaksiinanean gil; ginali muuchi gideaba manda ng'asheanji muy neasissi fuga Yahudi, ak eara ang'iing'i ginali muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama naaramwaschi deaweeda ghana iineasinyi ng'asheanda muy wassean miisa miyeeda, ea mwaaheawani miyeeda; ama ng'asheesu siirgweaksiinaneaniin ii mii huumwa ea manda siida jea ghwaadan, gaydaang'aata girgweageedeanyu heeda Gaysari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabalool Festo sea gweargwaaschi bea gheeda girgweageeda, gwayeesha, “Gigasayi ghang'ata girgweageadaang'u gawa heeda Gaysari; gajakuwi heeda Gaysari.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bawlo gwanda madeeda Agiripa sea Bernike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata eawoojisu ng'ay ghwahita Gaysariya sugoocheanda siguura Agiripa sea Bernike googeachi Festo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida hoowa ea gageanu eawoojiga saang'a, iimuchu ghoadaw Festo sugoocheanda iita girgweageeda nea gwayeesha, “Gwanda sih hiji ghayi nung'wa Feliki ghealooniga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea damandida eandeawi Yerusalemuun, hean ghapka ashoohoodiga hees ea gweargwa fuga Yahudi ak geahaakta, ak geemusan deargweaksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayeeshi saawa, nih mii naweeda fuga Rumi, aba gideaba gajeergweaksa siida siihaakta nea mii gwaroonyi fuga ahaakta ak geataw gheata jea ghaweada geaw aba ng'asheesu siihaaktaawaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghabwat geat aba hiji, ea mwaashiing'dani iimuchu geawi jeeda gheeda sirgweacha ak geapteadi, ak ghaanung' eeyeadu siidida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghamiinaada fugiga ahaaktaan, ea miidayiiy ng'asheanji muy siihaaktaawa ak ea mawuurji gidagwachi eararsiindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geaghus sheang'nyeeda nyaawa sea niny aba ng'asheega diini ea badayda siisi siguura Yesu ghayi meah, ak goomajeek Bawlo gideaba eamajeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean roat gichea daanyaashta huumeandeaba ng'asheesu, geabearsi gideaba gigasayi una Yerusalemu ak geergweakseey aba ng'asheesu siihaaktaawaneeyiini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gamus Bawlo gideaba anung'waadanaan deabiida ghealooniga ak gayghoang'aata girgweageadaanyi heeda sugoocheanda haweewa sean, ghaanung' eefur ea ghwahita eaweeda jea daada heeda Gaysari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Agiripa ak gwayeesha Festo, “Geagasayi eara aniini dealeeysiit siisi.” Ghwalamda Festo ak gwayeesha, “Gajaleeysiiniit numuji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gaweewa gharbeeda Agiripa jeeda gheeda girgweageeda sea Bernike, nea goodeay shirikareeda hees, ea fuga hees bea mujiini. Hean ghwanung' Festo eeruudu Bawlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Festo ak gwayi, “Ea sugoocheandeanya was Agiripa ea buuneesean mida hiji siisi mida madeedeang'wean goong'ulayi nih ghayi gooniiksean fuga Yahudi mida ng'eang'i ea gea mida Yerusalemu, inyeesa geechuur nea geegasa nuustaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba meatkweedeanyu ea mwaadaahi ng'asheanji nisin muy miisa miyeeda; geaghus gideaba gagasa niny ghoang'aata girgweageadaanyi heeda sugoocheanda haweewa sean, hean ghaanung' eeyeadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini ea meandeawani gida huumwa jea dang'oorsa siideanyu haw aba badaydeaba siisi. Ak ghoah ng'asheanji eayeani madeedeang'wean raanya madeadaang'u ang'iing'i Sugoocheanda was Agiripa, ak iinyearayi ng'asheega gaydanyas gichea dang'waar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghaadaayi mwadoabiiwa, gideaba ghaayaachi siida ghealooniga nea meeng'oorsiina ng'asheega siihaaktaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
